@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam linetype ortho
autonumber

title Test Case Execution Workflow
top to bottom direction

:Step 1: Test Preparation;
:Step 2: Navigate to the Login Page;
:Step 3: Verify UI Elements;
:Step 4: Perform Positive Login Test;
:Step 5: Perform Negative Login Tests;
:Step 6: Check Security Validation;
:Step 7: Verify "Remember Me";
:Step 8: Check Session Timeout;
:Step 9: Verify Logout Functionality;
:Step 10: Reporting and Clean-Up;

note right of last
Objective: Finalize test case execution.
end note

@enduml